ates; the same two replacements are used for recent and older windows. Comparisons are unavailable when fewer than two replacements exist.", "Four-event random-control bands contain their corresponding primary windows but overlap each other; they are broad recency controls, not exact-distance matches.", "Diagnostic RNG and module training modes are restored. Loader iterator cursors and worker-local RNG states cannot be restored; use a separate diagnostic loader when resuming training.", "This diagnostic patch does not implement the proposed readout, encoder position-ID hook, checkpoint architecture, predictor reconstruction, or host selection policy. Those require separate training-code changes.", "Position-hook support does not prove that an implementation honors supplied position IDs.", "Perturbations may be out of distribution and establish neither generalization nor causal preferences.", "Bootstrap intervals resample diagnostic users and condition on this model, sample, and candidates.", "No reviews, ratings, item categories, prices, stores, or simulator traits are measured.", "Unavailable comparisons return null measurements with count zero; they were not executed."], "Electronics:embedding_collapse_score": 0.5062001943588257, "Electronics:embedding_sample_count": 2048, "Electronics:embedding_excluded_count": 0, "Electronics:pos_neg_margin_mean": 1.381, "Electronics:pos_neg_margin_p10": -0.659, "Electronics:pos_neg_neg_beats_pos_rate": 0.2007, "Electronics:pos_neg_small_margin_rate": 0.306, "Electronics:training_pair_count": 10317, "Electronics:training_batch_count": 10, "Electronics:training_pair_nonfinite_count": 0, "Electronics:pos_neg_margin_category_breakdown": {"eps": 0.5, "low_margin_total_positions": 3157, "wrong_rank_total_positions": 2071, "low_margin_top_categories": {"pos_item": [], "neg_item": []}, "wrong_rank_top_categories": {"pos_item": [], "neg_item": []}}, "Electronics:sequence_feature_geometry": {"effective_rank": 50.9569804259373, "mean_norm