versity/conformity traits from interaction IDs. Preserve all four dataset routes, DATA_DIR=os.environ['GAGC_DATA_DIR'], trial-local artifacts, preprocessing seed 0, training seed 42, and SASREC_EPOCHS environment default 200. Diagnostic-only changes require no production predictor change; any promoted scoring or architecture change must update the predictor writer.",
